  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2302.09 Duplicate Vessel Registration Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2302.09 Duplicate Vessel Registration Certificate.\n\n(a) In the event a vessel registration certificate is lost, stolen, or damaged, the owner shall complete Form RDMV 110 “Application for Copy of Registration” (rev. 7/25) and submit it to the department.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a completed form RDMV 110 and payment of the required fee of $15.00, the department shall issue a duplicate vessel registration certificate.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss by #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
